160
00:07:28,850 --> 00:07:29,906
Get out of here.

161
00:07:29,987 --> 00:07:32,245
You're getting on that plane
in three hours either way,

162
00:07:32,346 --> 00:07:34,980
so would you rather seek out
terrorist scum here on the ground now

163
00:07:35,041 --> 00:07:36,422
