164
00:07:37,577 --> 00:07:38,616
Fine.

165
00:07:38,861 --> 00:07:40,262
Yo, we're on.
Let's go.

166
00:07:40,721 --> 00:07:42,223
Hey, and seek out Ari too.

167
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:44,314
He's gotta be
around here somewhere.

168
00:07:44,537 --> 00:07:47,664
