196
00:08:48,370 --> 00:08:51,416
so get off my ass and go get
my wife her favorite flowers.

197
00:08:51,924 --> 00:08:54,092
- Do you even know what those are?
- No, but you do.

198
00:08:54,153 --> 00:08:55,189
Remember that.

199
00:08:55,270 --> 00:08:58,397
And remember I know what my favorite
