216
00:09:38,963 --> 00:09:40,608
<i>Blue Velvet</i> maybe,

217
00:09:41,660 --> 00:09:43,553
<i>Henry portrait of a serial killer</i>.

218
00:09:43,938 --> 00:09:45,522
I've seen them both 20 times also.

219
00:09:46,266 --> 00:09:48,171
I'm a cinephile
and I see everything.

220
00:09:48,213 --> 00:09:49,979
